### DRC

What it does? Rule base analysis for the Infinispan CR. 
Where as the rules? rules.csv
How it does? Advisor engine runs, gets the Advisor rules, and reads from the CSV rules based.
How to run it? 
	Command based line, via python advisor.py /path/file.yaml
    Deploy web via python  python js/bridge_server.py - access via localhost:8080/1.

Where is the source?  https://github.com/FranciscoMeloJr/DRC/tree/2026-revamp-version
 
Is it contanirized? Yes, via Dockerfile in /container. Image located in https://quay.io/repository/fdemeloj1/drc-advisor


[Web-based bridge_server.py] -> advisor_engine -> rules
[advisor_ui] -> [advisor_engine] -> [rules]

Pipeline:
	Edit: 
		$ change the file
	Build: 
		$ podman build  -f container/Dockerfile . --tag drc-advisor:v2
	Push: 
		$ podman push localhost/drc-advisor:v2 quay.io/fdemeloj1/drc-advisor:v2
	Deploy: 
		$ change the deployment yaml
		$ podman run --rm -it --memory=1000m -e GC_MAX_METASPACE_SIZE=1024 -e GC_METASPACE_SIZE=200 -p 8080:8080 --rm -it localhost/advisor:latest